{"ref":"BDB, חָצִיר²","hw":"חָצִיר²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חָצִיר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>Is 15:6</sup> <strong>green grass, herbage</strong>, abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָצִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:5\" href=\"/Numbers.11.5\">Nu 11:5</a> + 16 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.26\">2 K 19:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 129:6\" href=\"/Psalms.129.6\">ψ 129:6</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>grass</em>, as food for animals <a data-ref=\"I Kings 18:5\" href=\"/I_Kings.18.5\">1 K 18:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 40:15\" href=\"/Job.40.15\">Jb 40:15</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 104:14\" href=\"/Psalms.104.14\">ψ 104:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 147:8\" href=\"/Psalms.147.8\">147:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 27:25\" href=\"/Proverbs.27.25\">Pr 27:25</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁא</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵשֶׂב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.6\">Is 15:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁא</span> and <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶרֶק</span>); spec. of <em>leeks</em> (as still sometimes in Aramaic, v. Löw<sup>pp. 226, 228</sup>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:5\" href=\"/Numbers.11.5\">Nu 11:5</a> (v. Di); in sim. of abundant growth <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 44:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.44.4\">Is 44:4</a> (v. 𝔊 Ew Che); on <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.7\">Is 35:7</a>; v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חָצִיר\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חָצִיר\">I. חָצִיר</a> supr.<br><strong>2.</strong>  as type of what is quickly perishing <a data-ref=\"Job 8:12\" href=\"/Job.8.12\">Jb 8:12</a>, hence fig. of perishing enemies <span dir=\"rtl\">חֲצִיר גַּגּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:27\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.27\">Is 37:27</a> = <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.26\">2 K 19:26</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּשֶׁא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵשֶׂב</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 129:6\" href=\"/Psalms.129.6\">ψ 129:6</a>, i.e. having no depth of root; of wicked, soon to be cut down <a data-ref=\"Psalms 37:2\" href=\"/Psalms.37.2\">ψ 37:2</a>; with special reference to Israel’s oppressors <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.6\">Is 40:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ציץ</span> [<span dir=\"rtl\">השׂרה</span>]), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.7\">7</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.8\">8</a> (‖ <em>id.</em>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.12\">51:12</a>; in sim. of frail man <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:5\" href=\"/Psalms.90.5\">ψ 90:5</a>; man’s days <a data-ref=\"Psalms 103:15\" href=\"/Psalms.103.15\">ψ 103:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">ציץ השׂדה</span>).","next":"BDB, חצר⁴","prev":"BDB, חצר³"}